<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classLtpClientServiceDataToSend" kindref="compound">LtpClientServiceDataToSend</ref> class encapsulates the bundle or user data to send and keep persistent while an LTP session is alive and asynchronous UDP send operations are ongoing. The class can hold a vector&lt;uint8_t&gt; or a ZeroMQ message. Messages are intended to be moved into this class to avoid memory copies. The data is then able to be destroyed once the LTP send session completes/closes. </para>
</sect1>
